  "draftIsFinal": false,
  "summary": "I wrote `src/main.ts`, which builds the whole handcart from Aura3D primitives. `typecheck` passes. I couldn't run `vite build` or open the page in a browser, so the render is unchecked.\n\n- **Bed:** 10 floor planks with varied length, tone, tilt and height, plus 4 corner posts. Each long side has 3 cross rails and each end has 2. Iron bands and bolts are on the posts and rails, and iron straps run across the floor.\n- **Frame and handles:** two runners under the bed. Two long push handles slope up at the rear, with thicker grips, iron end caps and cross braces.\n- **Wheels:** two, on one shared axle with linchpins. Each has a hub with iron bands, a cap and bolts, 12 spokes, 12 wooden rim segments, an iron tyre and nails. That makes 24 spokes in total.\n- **Front leg:** a front cross beam with two splayed legs and a foot bar.\n- **Cargo:** 4 sacks, 1 barrel with iron hoops, 3 crates (one stacked) and a rope coil.\n- **Ground and scene:** a dirt plane with darker dirt patches and 16 scattered stones. Lighting is a warm sun with soft PCF shadows, a hemisphere light and a neutral environment. There is a warm fog, and the camera gives a three-quarter view.\n- **Motion:** the whole cart turntables slowly, and the wheels also spin on the axle. Wheel spin uses `app.nodes.require`, which works on the nodes marked mutable.\n- **Task state:** after `await app.ready()` and the next animation frame, the code sets `window.__EVAL_READY__ = true` and `window.__TASK_STATE__ = { ready: true, wheelCount: 2, spokeCount: 24, plankCount: 10 }`. `plankCount` counts only the floor planks. The side rails are not counted as planks.\n\n",
